      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners value the hands-on care provided by attending veterinarians and assistants during examination room visits. Clinicians are described as kind and thorough when administering vaccines and treating routine health concerns. However, several reviewers report encounters with unhelpful front desk communication."
      }
    },
