      "title": {
        "en": "Affordable rates alongside billing disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The clinic is widely recognized in the Bronx for budget-friendly examination fees, vaccinations, and spay/neuter operations. Many clients appreciate the affordable alternative to costly private hospitals. Nonetheless, isolated reviews mention disagreements over payment terms and unexpected charges for additional tests."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "negative",
