      "title": {
        "en": "Prolonged waiting times and scheduling issues"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Excessive waiting times represent the most frequent complaint among visitors to this Cross Bronx Expressway facility. Several pet parents describe waiting between one and three hours past their scheduled arrival times before seeing a veterinarian. A few clients even left without being seen due to severe appointment delays."
      }
    }
  ],
